Spyxy's DPS Meter
https://github.com/khadesh/SpyxysDPSMeter
Copyright (c) 2026 khadesh

The crowd-control spell classification seed list in
src/EQBuddy.Core/SpellCatalog.cs is adapted from the spell-name tables in Spyxy's
DPS Meter, which groups EverQuest Legends spells by effect (charm, mesmerize,
root, lull, stun). EQBuddy's implementation differs — it collapses spell ranks
onto a base name and extends the list by observing the log at runtime — but the
idea and the starting set of names came from that project.

