QR code layout conventions (qrcode-generator)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
https://github.com/kazuhikoarase/qrcode-generator
Copyright (c) 2009 Kazuhiko Arase, MIT License

The second-screen pairing QR encoder (src/EQBuddy.Companion/QrEncoder.cs) was
