EQBuddy Sans (src/EQBuddy/Fonts/EQBuddySans*.ttf — Regular, SemiBold, Bold)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Built from Google's Noto fonts — Noto Sans, Noto Sans Symbols, Noto Sans
Symbols 2, Noto Sans Math, and Noto Emoji — all licensed under the SIL Open
Font License 1.1, whose full text ships beside the font in
src/EQBuddy/Fonts/OFL.txt.

The family ships three faces — Regular, SemiBold and Bold — because WPF
SYNTHESISES a weight a family cannot resolve, which mis-fits every bold run.
The SemiBold and Bold faces, and the small-caps features, were contributed by
quasarj (PR #231).

The font is a subset of those sources with EQBuddy's own 80-odd icon code
points merged into a Latin text base. It is renamed rather than shipped as
"Noto", per the OFL's reserved-name rule, because it is a modified version.
It loads ONLY under Wine — where prefixes ship no Segoe fonts and DirectWrite
consults just the primary font, so every icon boxes without it. Native Windows
never touches it.

Built and contributed by liminalwarmth (PR #148), together with
scripts/build-icon-font.py, which regenerates it reproducibly from pinned,
hash-verified sources. Thanks!
