Lineage
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
EQBuddy reads the log file the game already writes and nothing else — the
approach GamParse (https://gambosoft.eqresource.com) and nParse
(https://github.com/nomns/nparse) proved safe and useful across two decades
of classic EverQuest. Neither project's code is used here; the debt is the
idea that a log file is enough.
